{"file_id":"BRIEFING_MISSION_BLOCK_3818C0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Boss……有件事想跟你商量……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"什么事。\n别跟我说你想出口“MSF牌军粮”？\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":59,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那也不错……。\n……不对，Boss。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"MSF的士兵也增加了不少。\n差不多该开始向其他国家派遣雇佣兵了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"派遣雇佣兵吗……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":28,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不这么做的话，\n要养活这么多士兵可就难了。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":62,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"嗯……我知道……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":28,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"要派兵的话，从Mother Base选择\n<R=『OUTER OPS』,OUTER OPS>。\n","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=『OUTER OPS』,OUTER OPS>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"顺利的话，可能会获得士兵或武器设计图，\n也可能由此发现新的任务。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"还可以使用已经获得的车辆和大型兵器。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":55,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"不过要是失败了……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":31,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"我知道。\n我们的部下也有可能会死……。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":56,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"……我不会强求。\n这里的Boss是你。\n","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""}]}